node_modules
*.log

# Every environment file, however it is suffixed. `.env` alone was not enough: a real
# .env.production sitting next to it would have been committed, publishing live JWT signing
# secrets and database credentials. The *.example templates are the deliberate exceptions -
# they contain placeholders only.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example

# Automated database dumps (NFR10) — data, not source
backups/
